# NestFlow admin UI

Read before editing admin components.

## Layout

- Use reusable pieces in `src/components/admin/ui/` before adding markup inline.
- Default shell: metric sidebar (left) + pill tabs + main panel (right).
- One primary tab row: Tasks, Activity, Delivery, People. No nested Work/People toggle.

## Boss-friendly UX

- Prefer big numbers, short labels, and status colour tints over dense tables.
- Hide complex flows behind drawers or wizards (deactivate, team assign).
- Keep drag-and-drop as an optional Advanced section, not the default.

## Security

- Never weaken server guards or RLS to match UI-only restrictions.
- Oversight-only admins (`admin` without `line_manager` or `hr`) stay view-only on tasks.
- Align changes with `docs/engineering/ROLE_MATRIX.md` and ADR-003.

## Components

- Search [shoogle.dev](https://shoogle.dev/) for shadcn blocks before bespoke UI.
- Match NestFlow tokens: `#FF6300` primary, `font-heading`, `rounded-3xl`, semantic status colours.

## Code style

- Small files with plain props. One or two line comments only for non-obvious business rules.
- No inline imports. Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed.
